# Frontend conventions

- Use React + TypeScript components only.
- Use Tailwind CSS utilities with semantic design tokens from theme config.
- Use Radix primitives wrapped in shadcn-style local components for UI building blocks.
- Use Lucide React for icons and Framer Motion for meaningful micro-interactions.
- Use React Hook Form + Zod for form UX, not ad-hoc validation.
- Client code calls only internal `/api/*` routes and n8n endpoints through backend handlers.
